{
  "version": 1,
  "slug": "agent-desktop",
  "chapters": [
    {
      "number": 1,
      "title": "A desktop you can read",
      "claims": [
        {
          "id": "c1-01",
          "claim": "Agent Desktop lets an agent read and operate desktop applications. The agent decides what to do; this tool supplies observations and actions.",
          "caption": 0,
          "status": "verified",
          "sources": [
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
              "path": "README.md",
              "lines": "12-14",
              "label": "README.md"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c1-02",
          "claim": "The starting point is the accessibility tree: structured controls, names, and actions exposed by the operating system.",
          "caption": 1,
          "status": "verified",
          "sources": [
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
              "path": "CONCEPTS.md",
              "lines": "5-10",
              "label": "CONCEPTS.md"
            },
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
              "path": "crates/core/src/snapshot/mod.rs",
              "lines": "33-84",
              "label": "crates/core/src/snapshot/mod.rs"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c1-03",
          "claim": "First choose the window. If several windows match, the tool returns the candidates instead of guessing which one you meant.",
          "caption": 2,
          "status": "verified",
          "sources": [
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
              "path": "README.md",
              "lines": "73-76",
              "label": "README.md"
            },
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
              "path": "crates/core/src/snapshot/mod.rs",
              "lines": "214-268",
              "label": "crates/core/src/snapshot/mod.rs"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c1-04",
          "claim": "The snapshot walks that window and returns a tree. Each actionable or drillable node can receive a short reference, called a ref.",
          "caption": 3,
          "status": "verified",
          "sources": [
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
              "path": "CONCEPTS.md",
              "lines": "90-95",
              "label": "CONCEPTS.md"
            },
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
              "path": "crates/core/src/snapshot/mod.rs",
              "lines": "50-84",
              "label": "crates/core/src/snapshot/mod.rs"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c1-05",
          "claim": "That ref includes its snapshot identity. The element number alone is rejected, because it does not say which observation it came from.",
          "caption": 4,
          "status": "verified",
          "sources": [
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
              "path": "crates/core/src/refs/ref_token.rs",
              "lines": "3-30",
              "label": "crates/core/src/refs/ref_token.rs"
            },
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
              "path": "crates/core/src/refs/ref_token.rs",
              "lines": "54-59",
              "label": "crates/core/src/refs/ref_token.rs"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c1-06",
          "claim": "Behind the short ref, a saved map keeps identity evidence. Later commands use that evidence to look for the live element again.",
          "caption": 5,
          "status": "verified",
          "sources": [
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
              "path": "CONCEPTS.md",
              "lines": "97-111",
              "label": "CONCEPTS.md"
            },
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
              "path": "crates/core/src/refs/refs_store.rs",
              "lines": "46-65",
              "label": "crates/core/src/refs/refs_store.rs"
            },
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
              "path": "crates/core/src/refs/refs_store.rs",
              "lines": "98-100",
              "label": "crates/core/src/refs/refs_store.rs"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c1-07",
          "claim": "A full snapshot can run out of time and return a partial tree. Its completeness flag keeps missing branches from pretending to be empty.",
          "caption": 6,
          "status": "verified",
          "sources": [
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
              "path": "CONCEPTS.md",
              "lines": "32-35",
              "label": "CONCEPTS.md"
            },
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
              "path": "crates/core/src/commands/snapshot.rs",
              "lines": "136-149",
              "label": "crates/core/src/commands/snapshot.rs"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c1-08",
          "claim": "For a dense window, take a shallow skeleton and drill into one ref. A drill must finish before replacing that subtree in the saved map.",
          "caption": 7,
          "status": "verified",
          "sources": [
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
              "path": "crates/core/src/commands/snapshot.rs",
              "lines": "34-49",
              "label": "crates/core/src/commands/snapshot.rs"
            },
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
              "path": "crates/core/src/snapshot/snapshot_ref.rs",
              "lines": "30-37",
              "label": "crates/core/src/snapshot/snapshot_ref.rs"
            },
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
              "path": "crates/core/src/snapshot/snapshot_ref.rs",
              "lines": "97-107",
              "label": "crates/core/src/snapshot/snapshot_ref.rs"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c1-09",
          "claim": "The agent sends an action using the qualified ref. The tool resolves the target and returns a structured result about that command.",
          "caption": 8,
          "status": "verified",
          "sources": [
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
              "path": "README.md",
              "lines": "42-48",
              "label": "README.md"
            },
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
              "path": "crates/core/src/ref_action/mod.rs",
              "lines": "60-87",
              "label": "crates/core/src/ref_action/mod.rs"
            },
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
              "path": "crates/core/src/ref_action/mod.rs",
              "lines": "140-169",
              "label": "crates/core/src/ref_action/mod.rs"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c1-10",
          "claim": "Then the agent observes again. A command response is evidence about an operation; the next snapshot helps check what the application actually shows.",
          "caption": 9,
          "status": "verified",
          "sources": [
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
              "path": "README.md",
              "lines": "12-12",
              "label": "README.md"
            },
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
              "path": "README.md",
              "lines": "42-48",
              "label": "README.md"
            },
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
              "path": "crates/core/src/actions/post_action.rs",
              "lines": "128-138",
              "label": "crates/core/src/actions/post_action.rs"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "number": 2,
      "title": "A ref is a claim",
      "claims": [
        {
          "id": "c2-01",
          "claim": "A ref remembers an observation, not a permanent address. The desktop may change between the moment you read it and the moment you act.",
          "caption": 0,
          "status": "verified",
          "sources": [
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
              "path": "CONCEPTS.md",
              "lines": "90-111",
              "label": "CONCEPTS.md"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c2-02",
          "claim": "Resolution starts inside the selected snapshot namespace. A ref from one session cannot quietly reach into another session's saved map.",
          "caption": 1,
          "status": "verified",
          "sources": [
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
              "path": "CONCEPTS.md",
              "lines": "152-159",
              "label": "CONCEPTS.md"
            },
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
              "path": "crates/core/src/refs/refs_store.rs",
              "lines": "31-43",
              "label": "crates/core/src/refs/refs_store.rs"
            },
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
              "path": "crates/core/src/refs/refs_store.rs",
              "lines": "98-100",
              "label": "crates/core/src/refs/refs_store.rs"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c2-03",
          "claim": "The saved entry carries more than a name: process identity, source window, role, text, identifiers, geometry, and the original tree path.",
          "caption": 2,
          "status": "verified",
          "sources": [
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
              "path": "crates/core/src/refs/ref_entry.rs",
              "lines": "1-17",
              "label": "crates/core/src/refs/ref_entry.rs"
            },
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
              "path": "crates/core/src/refs/ref_identity.rs",
              "lines": "8-23",
              "label": "crates/core/src/refs/ref_identity.rs"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c2-04",
          "claim": "The process generation matters. A recycled process number must not turn an old ref into permission to act on a different running application.",
          "caption": 3,
          "status": "verified",
          "sources": [
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
              "path": "crates/macos/src/tree/resolve/mod.rs",
              "lines": "49-67",
              "label": "crates/macos/src/tree/resolve/mod.rs"
            },
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
              "path": "CONCEPTS.md",
              "lines": "75-80",
              "label": "CONCEPTS.md"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c2-05",
          "claim": "The stored path is a fast way to find a candidate. It is not proof of identity, so a row sliding into that position cannot win by position alone.",
          "caption": 4,
          "status": "verified",
          "sources": [
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
              "path": "CONCEPTS.md",
              "lines": "113-116",
              "label": "CONCEPTS.md"
            },
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
              "path": "crates/macos/src/tree/resolve/mod.rs",
              "lines": "70-110",
              "label": "crates/macos/src/tree/resolve/mod.rs"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c2-06",
          "claim": "Identity evidence has priorities. A retained native object takes precedence; otherwise the matcher uses a native identifier or suitable stable text.",
          "caption": 5,
          "status": "verified",
          "sources": [
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
              "path": "crates/core/src/refs/ref_identity.rs",
              "lines": "50-84",
              "label": "crates/core/src/refs/ref_identity.rs"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c2-07",
          "claim": "Text inside an editable field can change. The matcher avoids treating that changing value, or a name copied from it, as stable identity.",
          "caption": 6,
          "status": "verified",
          "sources": [
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
              "path": "crates/core/src/refs/ref_identity.rs",
              "lines": "26-46",
              "label": "crates/core/src/refs/ref_identity.rs"
            },
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
              "path": "crates/core/src/refs/ref_identity.rs",
              "lines": "205-244",
              "label": "crates/core/src/refs/ref_identity.rs"
            },
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
              "path": "CONCEPTS.md",
              "lines": "100-103",
              "label": "CONCEPTS.md"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c2-08",
          "claim": "If the path misses, a bounded search can look more broadly. Geometry can narrow competing identity matches; only refs without meaningful identity can rely on geometry alone.",
          "caption": 7,
          "status": "verified",
          "sources": [
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
              "path": "crates/macos/src/tree/resolve/resolve_classify.rs",
              "lines": "65-115",
              "label": "crates/macos/src/tree/resolve/resolve_classify.rs"
            },
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
              "path": "crates/macos/src/tree/resolve/resolve_tests_more.rs",
              "lines": "69-103",
              "label": "crates/macos/src/tree/resolve/resolve_tests_more.rs"
            },
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
              "path": "crates/windows/src/tree/resolve/resolve_match.rs",
              "lines": "97-122",
              "label": "crates/windows/src/tree/resolve/resolve_match.rs"
            },
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
              "path": "CONCEPTS.md",
              "lines": "113-116",
              "label": "CONCEPTS.md"
            },
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
              "path": "crates/macos/src/tree/resolve/mod.rs",
              "lines": "98-134",
              "label": "crates/macos/src/tree/resolve/mod.rs"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c2-09",
          "claim": "A missing match is stale. If the evidence still leaves competing matches, resolution is ambiguous. The tool refuses instead of choosing a convenient candidate.",
          "caption": 8,
          "status": "verified",
          "sources": [
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
              "path": "crates/macos/src/tree/resolve/resolve_classify.rs",
              "lines": "65-115",
              "label": "crates/macos/src/tree/resolve/resolve_classify.rs"
            },
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
              "path": "crates/macos/src/tree/resolve/resolve_tests_more.rs",
              "lines": "49-103",
              "label": "crates/macos/src/tree/resolve/resolve_tests_more.rs"
            },
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
              "path": "crates/macos/src/tree/resolve/mod.rs",
              "lines": "18-30",
              "label": "crates/macos/src/tree/resolve/mod.rs"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c2-10",
          "claim": "The recovery is another observation with fresh refs. Reusing the old token cannot make its missing identity evidence come back.",
          "caption": 9,
          "status": "verified",
          "sources": [
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
              "path": "README.md",
              "lines": "73-78",
              "label": "README.md"
            },
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
              "path": "crates/macos/src/tree/resolve/retained.rs",
              "lines": "107-125",
              "label": "crates/macos/src/tree/resolve/retained.rs"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "number": 3,
      "title": "Before the action lands",
      "claims": [
        {
          "id": "c3-01",
          "claim": "Finding the right element is only the first test. The tool must also decide whether this action is allowed and whether the target is ready.",
          "caption": 0,
          "status": "verified",
          "sources": [
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
              "path": "CONCEPTS.md",
              "lines": "178-191",
              "label": "CONCEPTS.md"
            },
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
              "path": "crates/core/src/ref_action/mod.rs",
              "lines": "60-92",
              "label": "crates/core/src/ref_action/mod.rs"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c3-02",
          "claim": "By default, ref actions use headless accessibility operations. They do not steal focus or move the pointer, and refuse when the semantic path is unavailable.",
          "caption": 1,
          "status": "verified",
          "sources": [
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
              "path": "CONCEPTS.md",
              "lines": "223-236",
              "label": "CONCEPTS.md"
            },
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
              "path": "crates/core/src/actions/interaction_policy.rs",
              "lines": "9-14",
              "label": "crates/core/src/actions/interaction_policy.rs"
            },
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
              "path": "crates/core/src/actions/interaction_policy.rs",
              "lines": "42-46",
              "label": "crates/core/src/actions/interaction_policy.rs"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c3-03",
          "claim": "Headed mode explicitly permits focus and cursor side effects. It does not guarantee every action works; the platform still chooses its supported mechanism.",
          "caption": 2,
          "status": "verified",
          "sources": [
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
              "path": "CONCEPTS.md",
              "lines": "223-226",
              "label": "CONCEPTS.md"
            },
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
              "path": "crates/core/src/actions/interaction_policy.rs",
              "lines": "23-31",
              "label": "crates/core/src/actions/interaction_policy.rs"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c3-04",
          "claim": "Before dispatch, live checks examine readiness, including visibility, enabled state, supported action, and policy. The checks depend on the requested operation.",
          "caption": 3,
          "status": "verified",
          "sources": [
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
              "path": "CONCEPTS.md",
              "lines": "180-191",
              "label": "CONCEPTS.md"
            },
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
              "path": "crates/core/src/ref_action/mod.rs",
              "lines": "53-58",
              "label": "crates/core/src/ref_action/mod.rs"
            },
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
              "path": "crates/core/src/ref_action/mod.rs",
              "lines": "89-134",
              "label": "crates/core/src/ref_action/mod.rs"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c3-05",
          "claim": "Temporary readiness problems can be polled within a deadline. Unsupported actions and policy refusals fail promptly instead of waiting for permission to change.",
          "caption": 4,
          "status": "verified",
          "sources": [
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
              "path": "CONCEPTS.md",
              "lines": "183-186",
              "label": "CONCEPTS.md"
            },
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
              "path": "crates/core/src/ref_action/ref_action_poll.rs",
              "lines": "88-110",
              "label": "crates/core/src/ref_action/ref_action_poll.rs"
            },
            {
              "repo": "vercel-labs/agent-desktop@9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d",
